*=======================================================================
* thiophene -- ground-state geometry optimisation
*
* The Kallen worked examples start from ETKDGv3/MMFF94 structures, which
* are not publishable geometries.  Reoptimised here at B3LYP/cc-pVDZ in
* C1, which is the convention stated in the contribution.  C1 is kept
* throughout: the production Dyson deck needs a fixed desymmetrised AO
* ordering, so optimising in C2v and running in C1 would renumber atoms
* between the two jobs.
*=======================================================================
&GATEWAY
  coord = thiophene_start.xyz
  basis = cc-pVDZ
  group = c1

>>> EXPORT MOLCAS_MAXITER=60
>>> DO WHILE

&SEWARD

&SCF
  KSDFT = B3LYP

&SLAPAF

>>> END DO
